class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/cybersecurity\">Cybersecurity</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/software-development\">Software Development</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/penetration-testing\">Penetration Testing</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/application-security\">Application Security</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/managed-detection-response\">Managed Detection &amp; Response</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/grc-compliance\">GRC &amp; Compliance</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/custom-software\">Custom Software</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/engagement-models\">Engagement Models</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services\">All <!-- -->services</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"nav__sheet-group\"><p class=\"nav__sheet-heading\">Industries</p><ul class=\"nav__sheet-list\"><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries/financial-services\">Financial Services</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries/healthcare\">Healthcare</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries/saas\">SaaS &amp; Technology</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries/logistics\">Logistics</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries/public-sector\">Public Sector</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries/retail\">Retail &amp; Payments</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries\">All <!-- -->industries</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"nav__sheet-group\"><p class=\"nav__sheet-heading\">Proof</p><ul class=\"nav__sheet-list\"><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/sample-report\">Anatomy of a report<span class=\"nav__sheet-blurb\">Walk a real deliverable, redacted. See what actually lands in your inbox.</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/case-studies\">Case Studies</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/customers\">Customers</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/certifications\">Certifications</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/trust\">Trust Centre</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"nav__sheet-group\"><p class=\"nav__sheet-heading\">Resources</p><ul class=\"nav__sheet-list\"><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/resources\">All resources</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/blog\">Insights</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/research\">Research &amp; Labs</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/tools\">Open-source tools</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/methodologies\">Methodologies</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"nav__sheet-group\"><p class=\"nav__sheet-heading\">Company</p><ul class=\"nav__sheet-list\"><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/about\">About</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/about/leadership\">Leadership</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/approach\">The Adversary Loop</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/careers\">Careers</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/newsroom\">Newsroom</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"nav__sheet-cta\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--md btn--full\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Start a conversation</span></a><a class=\"nav__sheet-hotline\" href=\"tel:+442045259100\">Incident response, 24/7 — <!-- -->+44 20 4525 9100</a></div></nav></details></div></div></header><main id=\"main\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"CollectionPage\",\"@id\":\"https://envenox.com/services/cybersecurity#collection\",\"name\":\"Cybersecurity\",\"description\":\"Testing, assurance, detection and response — by people who also ship production software.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/cybersecurity\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://envenox.com/#website\"},\"about\":{\"@id\":\"https://envenox.com/#organization\"},\"mainEntity\":{\"@type\":\"ItemList\",\"numberOfItems\":8,\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Penetration Testing\",\"description\":\"Manual, evidence-led testing with criticals reported the hour they are confirmed.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/penetration-testing\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Application Security\",\"description\":\"Secure code review, CI gates and threat models that engineers will actually maintain.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/application-security\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Cloud Security\",\"description\":\"Identity-path analysis across AWS, Azure and GCP, not a CSPM findings dump.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/cloud-security\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"GRC & Compliance\",\"description\":\"SOC 2, ISO 27001, PCI DSS, DORA and NIS2, evidenced from systems you already run.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/grc-compliance\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Managed Detection & Response\",\"description\":\"24/7 detection and response on your telemetry, with detections written for your architecture.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/managed-detection-response\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Incident Response\",\"description\":\"24/7 hotline answered by a responder. Retainer or emergency.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/incident-response\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":7,\"name\":\"Red Teaming\",\"description\":\"Objective-based adversary simulation, with a purple-team debrief that transfers the knowledge.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/red-teaming\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":8,\"name\":\"vCISO\",\"description\":\"Fractional security leadership, with an explicit plan to make itself redundant.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/vciso\"}]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Envenox\",\"item\":\"https://envenox.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Services\",\"item\":\"https://envenox.com/services\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Cybersecurity\",\"item\":\"https://envenox.com/services/cybersecurity\"}]}</script><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section grain\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" style=\"padding-top:calc(var(--nav-h) + var(--s16))\" aria-labelledby=\"pillar-h1\"><div class=\"u-container\"><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-hero__eyebrow\"><a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/services\">Services</a></p><h1 id=\"pillar-h1\" class=\"sv-h1\">Cybersecurity</h1><p class=\"sv-sub\">Testing, assurance, detection and response — by people who also ship production software.</p><p class=\"sv-lede\">Our testers are not career report-writers. They have shipped systems, which is why their findings arrive with a fix an engineer will accept rather than a recommendation an engineer has to translate.</p><div class=\"sv-hero__actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Start a conversation</span></a><a class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--lg\" href=\"/services/devsecops\"><span>Secure SDLC</span></a></div><ul class=\"sv-hero__meta\"><li>8 services</li><li>A named engineer replies within one business day. Scoping call within three.</li></ul></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" aria-labelledby=\"pillar-services\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">What you can buy</p><h2 id=\"pillar-services\" class=\"sv-h2\">Cybersecurity services</h2><p class=\"sv-head__lede\">Testing, assurance, detection and response — by people who also ship production software.</p></div><ul class=\"reveal-group sv-grid sv-grid--3\"><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bug sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 20v-9\"></path><path d=\"M14 7a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v3a6 6 0 0 1-12 0v-3a4 4 0 0 1 4-4z\"></path><path d=\"M14.12 3.88 16 2\"></path><path d=\"M21 21a4 4 0 0 0-3.81-4\"></path><path d=\"M21 5a4 4 0 0 1-3.55 3.97\"></path><path d=\"M22 13h-4\"></path><path d=\"M3 21a4 4 0 0 1 3.81-4\"></path><path d=\"M3 5a4 4 0 0 0 3.55 3.97\"></path><path d=\"M6 13H2\"></path><path d=\"m8 2 1.88 1.88\"></path><path d=\"M9 7.13V6a3 3 0 1 1 6 0v1.13\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/penetration-testing\">Penetration Testing</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Manual, evidence-led testing with criticals reported the hour they are confirmed.</p><ul class=\"sv-card__list\"><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Technical report — every finding with CVSS v4.0 vector, affected component, reproduction path, raw request/response evidence, and a remediation we would accept in code review</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Executive summary — two pages, written for a board, with the risk narrative and the three decisions that matter</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Findings register as CSV and JSON, keyed for direct import into Jira, Linear or ServiceNow</span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-card__cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">View Penetration Testing<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-code2 lucide-file-code-2 sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 22h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7l-5-5H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"m5 12-3 3 3 3\"></path><path d=\"m9 18 3-3-3-3\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/application-security\">Application Security</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Secure code review, CI gates and threat models that engineers will actually maintain.</p><ul class=\"sv-card__list\"><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Threat model per bounded context, authored by your engineers, in your repository</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Code review findings as pull request comments plus tickets in your tracker</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Working CI configuration for SAST, DAST, SCA and secret scanning, with the tuning rationale documented</span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-card__cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">View AppSec<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-cloud sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M17.5 19H9a7 7 0 1 1 6.71-9h1.79a4.5 4.5 0 1 1 0 9Z\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/cloud-security\">Cloud Security</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Identity-path analysis across AWS, Azure and GCP, not a CSPM findings dump.</p><ul class=\"sv-card__list\"><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Identity graph with every privilege-escalation and lateral-movement path, as a diagram and as queryable data</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Configuration findings filtered to what is exploitable in your topology, with CIS benchmark mapping</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Detection coverage matrix against MITRE ATT&amp;CK for Cloud</span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-card__cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">View Cloud Security<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-scroll-text sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 12h-5\"></path><path d=\"M15 8h-5\"></path><path d=\"M19 17V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4\"></path><path d=\"M8 21h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-1a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H11a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v1a2 2 0 1 1-4 0V5a2 2 0 1 0-4 0v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/grc-compliance\">GRC &amp; Compliance</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">SOC 2, ISO 27001, PCI DSS, DORA and NIS2, evidenced from systems you already run.</p><ul class=\"sv-card__list\"><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Readiness report with a costed, ordered gap list</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Risk methodology, risk register and Statement of Applicability</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Policy set written for your organisation, not a template pack</span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-card__cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">View GRC &amp; Compliance<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-radar sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19.07 4.93A10 10 0 0 0 6.99 3.34\"></path><path d=\"M4 6h.01\"></path><path d=\"M2.29 9.62A10 10 0 1 0 21.31 8.35\"></path><path d=\"M16.24 7.76A6 6 0 1 0 8.23 16.67\"></path><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path><path d=\"M17.99 11.66A6 6 0 0 1 15.77 16.67\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"m13.41 10.59 5.66-5.66\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/managed-detection-response\">Managed Detection &amp; Response</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">24/7 detection and response on your telemetry, with detections written for your architecture.</p><ul class=\"sv-card__list\"><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Detection repository, version-controlled, mapped to MITRE ATT&amp;CK, yours to keep</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Validated log source inventory with coverage gaps named</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Incident runbook with agreed containment authority and escalation paths</span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-card__cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">View MDR<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-siren sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 18v-6a5 5 0 1 1 10 0v6\"></path><path d=\"M5 21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h12a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M21 12h1\"></path><path d=\"M18.5 4.5 18 5\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h1\"></path><path d=\"M12 2v1\"></path><path d=\"m4.929 4.929.707.707\"></path><path d=\"M12 12v6\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/incident-response\">Incident Response</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">24/7 hotline answered by a responder. Retainer or emergency.</p><ul class=\"sv-card__list\"><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Incident timeline with evidence references and chain of custody</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Root cause analysis naming the control that failed and the control that would have caught it</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Indicators of compromise, with detections to prevent recurrence</span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-card__cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">View Incident Response<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-swords sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polyline points=\"14.5 17.5 3 6 3 3 6 3 17.5 14.5\"></polyline><line x1=\"13\" x2=\"19\" y1=\"19\" y2=\"13\"></line><line x1=\"16\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"20\"></line><line x1=\"19\" x2=\"21\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"19\"></line><polyline points=\"14.5 6.5 18 3 21 3 21 6 17.5 9.5\"></polyline><line x1=\"5\" x2=\"9\" y1=\"14\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"7\" x2=\"4\" y1=\"17\" y2=\"20\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"5\" y1=\"19\" y2=\"21\"></line></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/red-teaming\">Red Teaming</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Objective-based adversary simulation, with a purple-team debrief that transfers the knowledge.</p><ul class=\"sv-card__list\"><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Attack narrative with a full timeline and the evidence for each step</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Detection and response assessment: what fired, what did not, and how long each decision took</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Technique-by-technique ATT&amp;CK mapping with your coverage marked</span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-card__cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">View Red Teaming<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-user-cog sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 15H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"m14.305 16.53.923-.382\"></path><path d=\"m15.228 13.852-.923-.383\"></path><path d=\"m16.852 12.228-.383-.923\"></path><path d=\"m16.852 17.772-.383.924\"></path><path d=\"m19.148 12.228.383-.923\"></path><path d=\"m19.53 18.696-.382-.924\"></path><path d=\"m20.772 13.852.924-.383\"></path><path d=\"m20.772 16.148.924.383\"></path><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"15\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/vciso\">vCISO</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Fractional security leadership, with an explicit plan to make itself redundant.</p><ul class=\"sv-card__list\"><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Posture assessment and costed risk baseline</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Board-ready security strategy and quarterly reporting pack</span></li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-card__tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Risk register with owners, treatments and closure dates</span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-card__cta\" aria-hidden=\"true\">View vCISO<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></p></div></li></ul></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"deep\" aria-labelledby=\"pillar-join\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Where this pillar meets the other one</p><h2 id=\"pillar-join\" class=\"sv-h2\">Secure SDLC</h2><p class=\"sv-head__lede\">We build it and we break it. The findings land in our own sprint backlog.</p></div><div class=\"sv-rail\"><div class=\"sv-rail__aside\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-git-branch\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color:var(--accent)\"><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"15\"></line><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"6\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"18\" r=\"3\"></circle><path d=\"M18 9a9 9 0 0 1-9 9\"></path></svg><p class=\"sv-lede\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s4)\">One firm, two practices, one backlog. The seam between build and break, removed.</p><p style=\"margin-top:var(--s6)\"><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--brand\">9 days median</span></p></div><div class=\"sv-rail__body\"><p class=\"sv-prose-measure\" style=\"margin:0;color:var(--muted-strong)\">The standard arrangement is that a development firm builds your software for forty weeks and a security firm tests it in week forty-one. Everything that test finds is now expensive, because the architecture is set, the team is rolling off, and a finding that requires a design change arrives after the design is load-bearing. Both firms behaved correctly and the outcome is still bad. Our two practices run against each other continuously instead: our testers review the design before it is built, read the code as it is written, and raise findings into the same backlog our engineers work from. The number that matters is the nine days between a finding being confirmed and the fix being live, and it is only possible because there is no handover in the middle.</p><p style=\"margin-top:var(--s6)\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--md\" href=\"/services/devsecops\"><span>Read Secure SDLC</span><span class=\"btn__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section-tight\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" aria-labelledby=\"pillar-accred\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Accreditation</p><h2 id=\"pillar-accred\" class=\"sv-h2\">Certifications</h2></div><ul class=\"sv-accred\"><li class=\"sv-accred__item\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check sv-accred__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span><span class=\"sv-accred__label\">ISO/IEC 27001:2022 — Information Security Management</span><span class=\"sv-accred__issuer\">UKAS-accredited certification body</span></span></li><li class=\"sv-accred__item\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check sv-accred__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span><span class=\"sv-accred__label\">SOC 2 Type II — Security, Availability, Confidentiality</span><span class=\"sv-accred__issuer\">Independent CPA firm</span></span></li><li class=\"sv-accred__item\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check sv-accred__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span><span class=\"sv-accred__label\">Cyber Essentials Plus — audited technical controls</span><span class=\"sv-accred__issuer\">IASME, on behalf of the NCSC</span></span></li><li class=\"sv-accred__item\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check sv-accred__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span><span class=\"sv-accred__label\">CREST member — penetration testing</span><span class=\"sv-accred__issuer\">CREST International</span></span></li><li class=\"sv-accred__item\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check sv-accred__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span><span class=\"sv-accred__label\">PCI QSA — qualified assessor company</span><span class=\"sv-accred__issuer\">PCI Security Standards Council</span></span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-note\"><a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/certifications\">Every certificate number and expiry date is published</a> · <a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/trust\">Our own security posture</a></p></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section-tight\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" aria-labelledby=\"pillar-proof\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Capacity</p><h2 id=\"pillar-proof\" class=\"sv-h2\">Envenox at a glance</h2></div><ul class=\"statbar statbar--4\" aria-label=\"Envenox at a glance\"><li class=\"stat stat--md\"><p class=\"stat__figure u-tnum\"><span class=\"stat__roll\"><span class=\"stat__value\">38</span></span></p><p class=\"stat__label\">engineers and testers on staff</p><details class=\"stat__prov\"><summary>Source</summary><p>Internal headcount register · as of 2026-10-01</p></details></li><li class=\"stat stat--md\"><p class=\"stat__figure u-tnum\"><span class=\"stat__roll\"><span class=\"stat__value\">11</span></span></p><p class=\"stat__label\">years operating</p><details class=\"stat__prov\"><summary>Source</summary><p>Companies House incorporation record · as of 2026-01-01</p></details></li><li class=\"stat stat--md\"><p class=\"stat__figure u-tnum\"><span class=\"stat__roll\"><span class=\"stat__value\">240</span></span><span class=\"stat__suffix\">+</span></p><p class=\"stat__label\">engagements delivered</p><details class=\"stat__prov\"><summary>Source</summary><p>Delivery system export · as of 2026-10-01</p></details></li><li class=\"stat stat--md\"><p class=\"stat__figure u-tnum\"><span class=\"stat__roll\"><span class=\"stat__value\">71</span></span></p><p class=\"stat__label\">net promoter score</p><details class=\"stat__prov\"><summary>Source</summary><p>Post-engagement survey, 94 responses · as of 2026-09-30</p></details></li></ul><div style=\"margin-top:var(--s16)\"><p class=\"u-eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--s6)\">Selected clients</p><div class=\"marquee\" style=\"--gap:var(--s12);--marquee-dur:52s\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Selected clients\"><ul class=\"marquee__track mq-track\" aria-label=\"Selected clients\"><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Northgate Freight</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Logistics</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Lumen Clinical</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Healthcare</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Verity Payments</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Financial Services</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Aldercross Group</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Manufacturing</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Mereway Housing</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Public Sector</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Hallstead Retail</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Retail &amp; Payments</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Carrick Analytics</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">SaaS &amp; Technology</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Pelham Energy</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Energy</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Severn Mutual</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Insurance</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Orbis Education</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Education</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Northgate Freight</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Logistics</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Lumen Clinical</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Healthcare</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Verity Payments</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Financial Services</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Aldercross Group</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Manufacturing</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Mereway Housing</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Public Sector</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Hallstead Retail</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Retail &amp; Payments</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Carrick Analytics</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">SaaS &amp; Technology</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Pelham Energy</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Energy</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Severn Mutual</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Insurance</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Orbis Education</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Education</span></span></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-light transition-theme u-section grain\" data-theme-section=\"light\" aria-labelledby=\"pillar-cross\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">The other pillar</p><h2 id=\"pillar-cross\" class=\"sv-h2\">Software Development</h2><p class=\"sv-head__lede\">Products, platforms and business systems built to survive an audit and a handover.</p></div><p class=\"sv-prose-measure\" style=\"color:var(--muted-strong)\">Our engineers work next to a security practice that will attack what they build. That changes how authorisation, audit logging and secrets get designed — before the first commit rather than after the first report.</p><div class=\"sv-hero__actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\" href=\"/services/software-development\"><span>See Software Development</span><span class=\"btn__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section-tight\" data-theme-section=\"dark\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-cta-band\"><div><h2 class=\"sv-h2\">Book a 60-minute scoping call</h2><p class=\"sv-lede\">A technical conversation with the person who would lead the work — not a qualification script, not a discovery deck. You come away with a written scope, the exclusions stated in the body rather than in an appendix, and a day count that we have not padded.</p></div><div class=\"sv-cta-band__actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Start a conversation</span></a><a class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--lg\" href=\"/case-studies\"><span>See the work</span></a></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"foot theme-dark transition-theme grain\" data-theme-section=\"dark\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"foot__top\"><div class=\"foot__brand\"><a class=\"foot__wordmark\" href=\"/\">Envenox</a><p class=\"foot__positioning\">Envenox is a software development firm. We ship production systems — custom software, web applications, ERP and the platforms underneath them — and we keep an offensive security practice on staff that attacks what we build before anyone else gets the chance.</p><a class=\"foot__hotline\" href=\"tel:+442045259100\" data-ir-hotline=\"footer\"><span class=\"foot__hotline-row\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384\"></path></svg><span class=\"u-eyebrow\">Incident response — 24/7</span></span><span class=\"foot__hotline-number\">+44 20 4525 9100</span><span class=\"foot__hotline-note\">Answered by a responder, 24/7. Median pickup under 4 minutes.</span></a></div><nav class=\"foot__cols\" aria-label=\"Footer\"><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Cybersecurity</h2><ul class=\"foot__list\"><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/penetration-testing\">Penetration Testing</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/application-security\">Application Security</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/cloud-security\">Cloud Security</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/red-teaming\">Red Teaming</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/managed-detection-response\">Managed Detection &amp; Response</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/incident-response\">Incident Response</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/grc-compliance\">GRC &amp; Compliance</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/vciso\">vCISO</a></li></ul></div><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Software Development</h2><ul class=\"foot__list\"><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/custom-software\">Custom Software</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/web-application-development\">Web Applications</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/platform-engineering\">Platform &amp; DevOps</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/erp\">ERP</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/crm\">CRM</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/hrm\">HRM</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/lms\">LMS</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/qa-automation\">QA &amp; Test Automation</a></li></ul></div><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Company</h2><ul class=\"foot__list\"><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/about\">About</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/about/leadership\">Leadership</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/approach\">The Adversary Loop</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/careers\">Careers</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/newsroom\">Newsroom</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/locations\">Locations</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/partners\">Partners</a></li></ul></div><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Proof &amp; Resources</h2><ul class=\"foot__list\"><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/case-studies\">Case Studies</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/sample-report\">Sample Report</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/customers\">Customers</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/certifications\">Certifications</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/trust\">Trust Centre</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/blog\">Insights</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/research\">Research &amp; Labs</a></li></ul></div></nav></div><div class=\"foot__mid\"><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Offices</h2><div class=\"foot__offices\"><div><p class=\"foot__office-city\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>London<!-- -->, <!-- -->United Kingdom</p><address class=\"foot__office-line\">1 Fore Street Avenue, London EC2Y 9DT</address></div><div><p class=\"foot__office-city\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Dhaka<!-- -->, <!-- -->Bangladesh</p><address class=\"foot__office-line\">Level 7, Bay’s Galleria, Gulshan 1, Dhaka 1212</address></div><div><p class=\"foot__office-city\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg>General enquiries</p><p class=\"foot__office-line\"><a class=\"foot__link u-link\" href=\"mailto:hello@envenox.com\">hello@envenox.com</a></p></div><div><p class=\"foot__office-city\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg>Security reports</p><p class=\"foot__office-line\"><a class=\"foot__link u-link\" href=\"mailto:security@envenox.com\">security@envenox.com</a></p></div></div></div><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Research notes</h2><form class=\"foot__form\" action=\"/api/newsletter\" method=\"post\"><label class=\"foot__form-label\" for=\"footer-newsletter-email\">Email address</label><div class=\"foot__form-row\"><input class=\"foot__input\" id=\"footer-newsletter-email\" type=\"email\" autoComplete=\"email\" required=\"\" aria-describedby=\"footer-newsletter-hint\" name=\"email\"/><button class=\"foot__submit\" type=\"submit\">Subscribe</button></div><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"source\" value=\"footer\"/><p class=\"foot__form-hint\" id=\"footer-newsletter-hint\">Advisories, teardowns and methodology notes. Roughly monthly. No sales sequence, one-click unsubscribe.</p></form></div></div><div class=\"foot__bottom\"><div class=\"foot__legal\"><p class=\"foot__legal-line\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->E