security\",\"description\":\"Testing, assurance, detection and response — by people who also ship production software.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/cybersecurity\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://envenox.com/#website\"},\"about\":{\"@id\":\"https://envenox.com/#organization\"},\"mainEntity\":{\"@type\":\"ItemList\",\"numberOfItems\":8,\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Penetration Testing\",\"description\":\"Manual, evidence-led testing with criticals reported the hour they are confirmed.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/penetration-testing\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Application Security\",\"description\":\"Secure code review, CI gates and threat models that engineers will actually maintain.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/application-security\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Cloud Security\",\"description\":\"Identity-path analysis across AWS, Azure and GCP, not a CSPM findings dump.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/cloud-security\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"GRC & Compliance\",\"description\":\"SOC 2, ISO 27001, PCI DSS, DORA and NIS2, evidenced from systems you already run.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/grc-compliance\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Managed Detection & Response\",\"description\":\"24/7 detection and response on your telemetry, with detections written for your architecture.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/managed-detection-response\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Incident Response\",\"description\":\"24/7 hotline answered by a responder. Retainer or emergency.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/incident-response\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":7,\"name\":\"Red Teaming\",\"description\":\"Objective-based adversary simulation, with a purple-team debrief that transfers the knowledge.\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com/services/red-teaming